    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σεβασμ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέβασις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				383.80
			</span></i> (Commagene, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.83
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεβασμὸν ἀποδοῦναι</span>
			Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				179
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν περὶ τῶν θεῶν ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
